ogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/eminent-domain-were-all-indians-now.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9062630689791315740' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/9062630689791315740' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1721344903"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 6, 2010 at 12:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6042639745998128703</id><published>2010-07-06T10:40:15.464-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-06T10:40:15.464-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My family has &amp;quot;owned&amp;quot; the same parcel of...</title><content type='html'>My family has &amp;quot;owned&amp;quot; the same parcel of land in west Texas for over 100 years.  It has occurred to me that we&amp;#39;ve never actually owned the land we have merely rented it for all those years.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m not convinced that the individual ever actually owns anything.  If we refuse, or cannot afford, to pay the rent the state will send some one with a gun to collect the money or seize the property.  If we resist, the state will kill us and take the property.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;[W3]</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9062630689791315740/comments/default/6042639745998128703'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/9062630689791315740/comments/default/6042639745998128703'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/eminent-domain-were-all-indians-now.html?showComment=1278434415464#c6042639745998128703' title=''/><author><name>W W Woodward</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13326046112820327760</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas